---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = 'Privacy Policy | Crestivo';
---

<MainLayout title={pageTitle}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[85rem] px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
        Last updated: January 1, 2021
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">1. Who We Are</h2>
          <p>Crestivo is a full-service marketing and technology agency located at 154 W 14th St, New York, NY 10011. We can be reached at Propertiesonlinellc@outlook.com.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect information you provide directly to us, including your name, email address, phone number, and any details you share when filling out our contact or consultation forms. We also collect your email address if you subscribe to our newsletter.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use the information we collect to respond to your inquiries, deliver services you purchase, send newsletters and promotional offers you have opted into, and improve our website and services.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">4. How We Share Your Information</h2>
          <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information with trusted service providers such as Stripe for payment processing and Mailchimp for email marketing, solely to operate our business and deliver our services.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">5. Payment Information</h2>
          <p>All payments are processed securely through Stripe. Crestivo does not store your credit card or payment information on our servers. Please review Stripe's privacy policy at stripe.com/privacy for more information.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">6. Newsletter & Email Marketing</h2>
          <p>If you subscribe to our newsletter, your email is stored securely through Mailchimp. You can unsubscribe at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in any email we send you.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">7. Cookies</h2>
          <p>Our website may use cookies to improve your browsing experience. You can choose to disable cookies through your browser settings at any time.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">8. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information at any time. To make a request, contact us at Propertiesonlinellc@outlook.com.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. Continued use of our website after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">10. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-medium text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400">Propertiesonlinellc@outlook.com</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">154 W 14th St, New York, NY 10011</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
